<section class="arm-block"><div class="arm-block-head"><h2>左臂 · 实车控制</h2><span>KR260 FPGA_CAN0 · 板载 CAN · v2 mode=2 关节直达</span></div><div class="arm-block-body"><div class="arm-col">

<div class="sim-card"><div class="sim-heading"><h2>左臂控制台</h2><span id="lst-left" class="sim-badge">左臂 · FPGA_CAN0</span></div><p class="sim-muted">实车控制：① 连接 CAN → ② 使能机械臂 → ③ 启动双臂程序。启动跟随先读取实际角度再分阶段到位：<b>J2～J6 只在 J1=0 的平面内移动，J1 只在伸展态偏航</b>——从零位进入则先展开再偏航，从伸展位回零则先把 J1 归零再收拢。过渡中反馈异常或超时将中止，并锁定软件停止。使能不会自动移动；「移动到起始 / 移动到零位」是显式定点移动，停止双臂程序会影响左右两臂。</p><div class="sim-con-status"><span>CAN <b id="lcon-can">—</b></span><span>deploy <b id="lst-deploy">—</b></span><span>跟随 <b id="lst-state">未开始</b></span></div><div class="sim-toolbar dense"><button id="lcon-status" class="button secondary">刷新状态</button><button id="lcon-prepare" class="button secondary">① 拉起 CAN</button><button id="lcon-enable" class="button secondary">② 使能机械臂</button><button id="lcon-start" class="button secondary">③ 启动双臂程序</button></div><div class="sim-toolbar dense"><button id="lcon-move-start" class="button secondary" disabled title="移动到跟随起始位姿：先在 J1=0 平面内展开/收拢 J2～J6，再偏航 J1">移动到起始</button><button id="lcon-move-zero" class="button secondary" disabled title="移动到零位（六轴 0°）：J1 偏离时先把 J1 归零，再收拢 J2～J6">移动到零位</button><button id="lcon-stop" class="button secondary">停止双臂程序</button><button id="lcon-exit-teach" class="button secondary" title="结束左臂普通拖动示教，切入 CAN / MOVE J；只切换模式，不自动运动">退出示教并切 CAN</button><button id="lcon-disable" class="button secondary" title="取消使能：六轴驱动器断使能，手臂失去保持力矩、会因自重下坠。deploy 运行中禁止操作，请先停止双臂程序。">取消使能</button></div><div class="sim-toolbar"><button id="lbtn-start" class="button primary">开始跟随</button><button id="lbtn-stop" class="button secondary">停止跟随</button></div><div class="sim-toolbar"><button id="lvr-start" class="button primary">VR 跟随</button><button id="lvr-stop" class="button secondary">停止 VR</button><button id="lbtn-read" class="button secondary">读取当前角度</button><button id="lvr-route" class="button primary" title="等同左手柄 X：记录当前位置→慢速搬运→位置3松爪5秒→返回原位并恢复夹持">左臂搬运流程（X）</button><button id="lvr-dual-home" class="button secondary" title="等同右手柄 A：中止当前任务，右臂、左臂依次返回起始位">双臂返回起始（A）</button></div><p class="sim-muted" id="lvr-info" style="margin:2px 0 0">左臂 VR：未启动。用<b>左手柄</b>，按住左侧键跟随、松开保持（与右臂同一套映射，可同时双手双臂）。滑块跟随前请先「读取当前角度」对齐真机姿态，否则手臂会跳向滑块位置。</p><div class="sim-con-status" aria-label="左臂搬运状态"><span>搬运 <b id="transfer-badge">空闲</b></span><span>阶段 <b id="transfer-stage">—</b></span></div><p id="transfer-detail" class="sim-muted" role="status">尚未启动搬运任务。</p><pre id="llog" class="sim-log">等待状态检查。请逐步操作，任一步失败后停止后续操作。</pre><details><summary>手动 SSH 流程（左臂备用）</summary><div class="sim-guide"><pre>sudo ip link set FPGA_CAN0 down 2>/dev/null; sudo ip link set FPGA_CAN0 type can bitrate 1000000 && sudo ip link set FPGA_CAN0 up
cd ~/piper_dual_arm_teleop/build
./tool enable left
sudo ./deploy</pre><ul class="sim-muted"><li>开始控制前务必先「读取当前角度」对齐滑块，否则手臂会跳向滑块位置</li><li>deploy 限速 0.8 rad/s（V3.0），大幅度请分段拖</li><li>指令无报错但手臂不动 = 驱动器锁存：机械臂断电 10 秒重上电，重新使能</li><li>收工：停止控制 → 停止控制程序 → 机械臂断电 → KR260 sudo poweroff</li></ul></div></details></div>

<div class="sim-card"><div class="sim-heading"><h2>左臂滑块控制</h2><div class="sim-mode"><button id="lmode-ee" class="button primary sim-mode-btn">末端位置</button><button id="lmode-joint" class="button secondary sim-mode-btn">关节模式</button></div></div>
<div id="panel-lee"><p class="sim-muted">与右臂统一：直接设定<b>底盘系 J5 中心</b>目标（+X 右 · +Y 前 · +Z 上，米）、RPY 姿态偏移与夹爪闭合量（0=张开，1=闭合）。采用机械臂 V3.0 全解析分层解算：<b>J1～J3 几何定位 J5，J4～J6 ZYZ 解析调姿</b>；v2 mode=2 关节直达，KR260 以 0.8 rad/s 限速执行。请先停止滑块跟随再切换 VR，数值保持不回中。</p><div class="sim-slider-groups"><fieldset class="sim-slider-group"><legend>左手 J5 中心（底盘系绝对坐标 m）</legend><label>X 右 <input id="llx" type="range" min="-0.5" max="0.5" step="0.005" value="-0.1514"><output id="llx-v">-0.151</output></label><label>Y 前 <input id="lly" type="range" min="-0.1" max="0.55" step="0.005" value="0.2885"><output id="lly-v">0.289</output></label><label>Z 上 <input id="llz" type="range" min="-0.25" max="0.6" step="0.005" value="0.2659"><output id="llz-v">0.266</output></label><label>夹爪 <input id="llg" type="range" min="0" max="1" step="0.01" value="0"><output id="llg-v">0.00</output></label></fieldset><fieldset class="sim-slider-group"><legend>夹爪朝向（相对水平姿态，度）</legend><label>滚转 Roll · 绕 X <input id="llroll" type="range" min="-180" max="180" step="1" value="0"><output id="llroll-v">0.0°</output></label><label>俯仰 Pitch · 绕 Y <input id="llpitch" type="range" min="-180" max="180" step="1" value="0"><output id="llpitch-v">0.0°</output></label><label>偏航 Yaw · 绕 Z <input id="llyaw" type="range" min="-180" max="180" step="1" value="0"><output id="llyaw-v">0.0°</output></label></fieldset></div></div>
<div id="panel-ljoint" hidden><p class="sim-muted">滑块为绝对关节角（度）；开始跟随后按关节目标发送。夹爪 0%=全开，100%=闭合。</p><div class="sim-slider-groups sim-joint-grid"><fieldset class="sim-slider-group"><legend>左臂关节角（绝对，度）</legend><label>J1 腰转 <input id="lj1" type="range" min="-150" max="150" step="0.5" value="0"><output id="lj1-v">0.0°</output></label><label>J2 肩俯仰 <input id="lj2" type="range" min="0" max="180" step="0.5" value="0"><output id="lj2-v">0.0°</output></label><label>J3 肘俯仰 <input id="lj3" type="range" min="-170" max="0" step="0.5" value="0"><output id="lj3-v">0.0°</output></label><label>J4 腕俯仰 <input id="lj4" type="range" min="-100" max="100" step="0.5" value="0"><output id="lj4-v">0.0°</output></label><label>J5 腕偏摆 <input id="lj5" type="range" min="-69.9" max="69.9" step="0.1" value="0"><output id="lj5-v">0.0°</output></label><label>J6 法兰旋 <input id="lj6" type="range" min="-120" max="120" step="0.5" value="0"><output id="lj6-v">0.0°</output></label><label>夹爪 <input id="lgrip" type="range" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="0"><output id="lgrip-v">0%</output></label></fieldset></div></div>
